# Guided tour (#58): coach marks shown on the first visit to each screen.

tour-step = { $n } of { $total }
tour-next = Next
tour-done = Got it
tour-skip = Skip tour
tour-replay = Tour
tour-reset = Show the tours again
tour-reset-done = The tours will show again on each screen.
tour-reset-title = Guided tours

tour-home-nav-title = Everything starts here
tour-home-nav-body = Learn has the lessons, Practice has the table, mental math and your reviews, Analyze has the hands you played.
tour-home-continue-title = Your next step
tour-home-continue-body = The next lesson to read. Each quiz you pass unlocks the next lessons.
tour-home-stats-title = Your daily routine
tour-home-stats-body = Reviews bring back what you got wrong, at the right time. Mental math trains the numbers you need at the table.

tour-tree-track-title = Tracks
tour-tree-track-body = Lessons come in tracks, in order. Locked lessons can still be read; only their quiz waits.
tour-tree-next-title = Start here
tour-tree-next-body = The highlighted lesson is the next one. Passing its quiz unlocks the following lessons.

tour-lesson-doc-title = Read with the glossary
tour-lesson-doc-body = Underlined words are poker terms: hover over them to see what they mean.
tour-lesson-quiz-title = The quiz
tour-lesson-quiz-body = Pass it to unlock the next lessons. Wrong answers come back in your reviews.

tour-table-controls-title = What to practice
tour-table-controls-body = Spot mode gives you one decision at a time. Full hand plays to the river. Pick the situation and the kind of opponent here.
tour-table-felt-title = The table
tour-table-felt-body = You are the highlighted seat at the bottom, with your cards face up. The pot and the bets are in the middle.
tour-table-actions-title = Your move
tour-table-actions-body = Pick an action. Every decision is graded by how much it costs compared with the best play.
tour-table-explanation-title = Why
tour-table-explanation-body = After each decision this panel shows the grade, what the reference strategy does and how the hand got here.

tour-calc-picker-title = Pick an exercise
tour-calc-picker-body = Each card trains one calculation. Mixed draws a bit of everything.
tour-calc-body-title = Answer against the clock
tour-calc-body-body = Type a number and press Enter. You see the exact answer next to the shortcut, and slow or wrong answers go to your reviews.

tour-review-title = Your review queue
tour-review-body = Spots you missed, wrong quiz answers and slow calcs come back here when you are about to forget them. A few minutes a day keeps them fresh.
tour-hand-review-title = Your hands
tour-hand-review-body = Every full hand you play lands here, with a grade for each decision and a step-by-step replay.
tour-settings-title = Make it yours
tour-settings-body = Language, theme, where the table panels go, backups and the strategy library live here.
